prepared forcing files using a combination of:
./prep_scripts/ -  see readme here
/data/project1/minnaho/roms-tools/bgc - make_s2r_bgcSRF.m

created WEC from SMODE 200 m WEC
/data/project1/minnaho/roms-tools/bry_ini/*wec*
then used ramp.py to ramp up the WEC overtime

created river file from SMODE 200 m river file using nco commands:
mc60_river_commands.txt

interpolated river positions and fractionated in 
/data/project9/minnaho/swel/rivers/make_rivers_grid.py

created pipe file from Marco's .mat file
/data/project1/minnaho/roms-tools/rivers/ROMS_CC_new.mat
/data/project1/minnaho/roms-tools/rivers/potw_grd.py
/data/project1/minnaho/roms-tools/rivers/potw_pip.py

added tracers to files using nco
- rst: add_trace_rst.py
- potw: /data/project1/minnaho/roms-tools/rivers/potw_pip.py
- river: /data/project9/minnaho/swel/tides/mc60/rivpip/add_tracer_riv.py
- bry: 
ncap2 -O -s '
    rtrace_west  = 0.0 * temp_west; 
    rtrace_south = 0.0 * temp_south; 
    rtrace_north = 0.0 * temp_north; '
    mc60_bry.20190415110220.nc mc60_bry_rtrace.20190415110220.nc

ncap2 -O -s \
    ptrace_west  = 0.0 * temp_west; \
    ptrace_south = 0.0 * temp_south; \
    ptrace_north = 0.0 * temp_north; \ 
    mc60_bry_rtrace.20190415110220.nc mc60_bry_trace.20190415110220.nc

ncatted -O \
  -a long_name,ptrace_north,o,c,"pipe tracer" \
  -a units,ptrace_north,o,c,"mmol m-3" \
  -a long_name,ptrace_south,o,c,"pipe tracer" \
  -a units,ptrace_south,o,c,"mmol m-3" \
  -a long_name,ptrace_west,o,c,"pipe tracer" \
  -a units,ptrace_west,o,c,"mmol m-3" \
  -a long_name,rtrace_north,o,c,"river tracer" \
  -a units,rtrace_north,o,c,"mmol m-3" \
  -a long_name,rtrace_south,o,c,"river tracer" \
  -a units,rtrace_south,o,c,"mmol m-3" \
  -a long_name,rtrace_west,o,c,"river tracer" \
  -a units,rtrace_west,o,c,"mmol m-3" \
  mc60_bry_trace.20190415110220.nc

